# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) for local development.
#
# Groq API key for the portfolio assistant (https://console.groq.com/keys).
# Server-only: read by api/chat.js on Vercel and by the dev/preview middleware
# in vite.config.js. Do NOT rename it to VITE_GROQ_API_KEY — Vite inlines
# VITE_ variables into the public JS bundle. In production, set it in the
# Vercel project's environment variables instead of a file.
GROQ_API_KEY=
